(text "Mux: USB (default), BT, AUX select by HP_SEL_B/HP_SEL_A = 00 / 01 / 1x. HP_SEL_A,B, HP_EN, HP_G0/G1 default low (pull-downs): USB, amp off, -6 dB." (at 25.4 193.04 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "ed8fa198-7436-4711-a396-78fc922d774b"))
(text "Sequence: HP_EN low, change HP_SEL, wait 1 ms, HP_EN high (5 ms start-up). Hold HP_EN, HP_G0, HP_G1 low while 3V3_AUDIO is off." (at 25.4 195.58 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "f2b90de4-5f67-4f2a-951f-5e37aca20a8e"))
(text "Inputs: 1 uF AC coupling, 100 k bias to VMID_HP (1.65 V from 3V3_AUDIO), 1 k series. TPA6132A2 inputs are single-ended (INL+/INR+ grounded)." (at 25.4 198.12 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "d49e7cab-c149-4029-ae65-df58d6b15355"))
(text "J2 switched tip (4) = HP_DET (low without plug, high with plug). J3 switched tip (4) = AUX_DET. Switched ring (3): not connected. No hardware speaker mute: firmware mutes the speaker chain on insertion." (at 25.4 200.66 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "afc2e76a-99fb-4358-82aa-3ef7fec147d5"))
(text "SGND (pin 15) goes to the J2 sleeve: route as its own trace to the jack sleeve ground, away from PGND. PESD5V0S2BT pin 3 = common: VERIFY against datasheet." (at 25.4 203.2 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "7a07fad3-6f37-46cc-bff2-ef77dfd53804"))
)
